      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wilson’s roots trace back to the late 18th century, when Southern settlers arrived after the 1795 Treaty of San Lorenzo and the 1803 Louisiana Purchase.",
